window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The battle for freedom is just beginning. In the shadows of a fractured world, where celestial and infernal forces vie for dominance, Eden delves into the heart of betrayal, redemption, and the desperate fight for freedom. Eden, a cunning spy burdened by the weight of her dark elf lineage, stands at the crossroads of destiny.</p> <p>As whispers of the enigmatic Darkswan and the apocalyptic Damius Nexus echo across the Abyss, Eden must navigate a perilous web of lies and alliances. Her companions—a demon-slaying High Priestess wielding cursed swords, a centuries-old fox-devil with secrets of her own, a fallen angel haunted by his past, and Kasai Ch’ou, the Ever Hero of this era—form a fragile resistance against the growing chaos. But the Abyss itself stirs, its seven hellish Layers rife with power-hungry devils, each vying for dominion.</p> <p>When Eden’s long-buried heritage threatens to shatter the unity among the dark elves, she must decide whether to embrace the darkness within or rise above it. As the lines between friend and foe blur, alliances crack under pressure, and every choice teeters on the brink of doom, the stakes have never been higher.</p> <p>With heart-pounding action, intricate world-building, and devastating emotional stakes, <i>Eden</i> propels listeners deeper into the Ever Hero Saga, where salvation and annihilation walk hand in hand. Will Eden become the hero her people need—or the harbinger of their destruction?</p>"; 
